{"seq":13,"slug":"educational-psychology","title":"教育与学校心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"教育与学校心理学-简介\">教育与学校心理学 简介</h1><p>本 hub 是心理学板块中&quot;把心理学规律用到教与学场景&quot;的应用分支。它不重复发展、认知、动机等基础心理学的原理铺陈，而是聚焦四类落地问题：人<strong>如何</strong>有效学习（学习理论）、学校场景中<strong>怎样</strong>支持不同学生（学校心理学）、教学者<strong>如何</strong>设计高效的教与评（教学心理学），以及表现情境下<strong>怎样</strong>调控状态（运动心理学）。读者无需教育学或心理学专业背景，但已具备基础逻辑与阅读能力的技术从业者、终身学习者、培训设计者会读得最顺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>本 hub 与多个相邻 hub 主题重叠，但切入角度不同。先看清边界，能避免在错的 hub 里找错的答案。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>议题</th>\n<th>本 hub 的定位</th>\n<th>应去的兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习/记忆/动机的<strong>基础机制</strong></td>\n<td>只引用、不展开</td>\n<td><a href=\"../cognitive-psychology/\">认知心理学</a>、<a href=\"../emotion-motivation-psychology/\">情绪与动机心理学</a>、<a href=\"../learning-behavioral-psychology/\">学习与行为心理学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>儿童与青少年的<strong>发展规律</strong></td>\n<td>作为入学准备/天才/特教的前提引用</td>\n<td><a href=\"../developmental-psychology/\">发展心理学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习障碍/ADHD/孤独症的<strong>临床诊断</strong></td>\n<td>只讲教育安置与支持</td>\n<td><a href=\"../clinical-abnormal-psychology/\">临床与异常心理学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测验<strong>信度/效度/IRT</strong> 等测量学</td>\n<td>只讲评估在教学中的用法</td>\n<td><a href=\"../psychometrics/\">心理测量学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动与竞技表现的<strong>完整体系</strong></td>\n<td>给学习者一个精炼入口</td>\n<td><a href=\"../sport-exercise-psychology/\">运动与锻炼心理学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>课程设计/教育技术/教育系统</td>\n<td>只讲教与学的心理机制</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../education/education-fundamentals/learning-theories/constructivist-learning\">教育（学科）</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人学习方法的<strong>实操手册</strong></td>\n<td>提供理论依据</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../learning/learning-methodology/metacognition/growth-mindset\">学习方法论</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 回答&quot;心理学告诉我们教与学应该怎么做&quot;，运动心理学 hub 是更专的竞技分册，教育 hub 是更偏制度与课程的姊妹篇，学习 hub 是面向个人的实操对照。</strong> 第 4 章运动心理学与 <code>23_sport-exercise-psychology</code> 有意保留交叠：本 hub 给&quot;会学习的人&quot;一个状态调控入口，专册给运动从业者完整训练体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按目标分人群，路径不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>想优化自己的学习（程序员/终身学习者）</strong>：第 1 章<a href=\"learning-theories/constructivism\">建构主义</a> → <a href=\"learning-theories/self-regulated-learning\">自我调节学习</a> → <a href=\"learning-theories/transfer-of-learning\">学习迁移</a>，再跳到第 3 章<a href=\"instructional-psychology/motivation-in-education\">学习动机</a>。配合 <a href=\"../../learning/learning-methodology/metacognition/growth-mindset\">学习方法论 hub</a> 落地。</li>\n<li><strong>要设计培训/带新人（技术管理者、导师）</strong>：第 1 章<a href=\"learning-theories/situated-learning\">情境学习</a>（认知学徒制）→ 第 3 章全章（动机、课堂管理、评估反馈、师生关系），把&quot;课堂&quot;替换成&quot;团队&quot;即可迁移。</li>\n<li><strong>关注教育公平与个体差异（家长、教育工作者）</strong>：直接进第 2 章<a href=\"school-psychology/school-readiness\">入学准备</a> → <a href=\"school-psychology/gifted-education\">天才教育</a> → <a href=\"school-psychology/special-education\">特殊教育</a> → <a href=\"school-psychology/bullying-prevention\">欺凌预防</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>做压力与状态管理</strong>：第 4 章<a href=\"sports-psychology/peak-performance\">巅峰表现</a> → <a href=\"sports-psychology/mental-toughness\">心理韧性</a> → <a href=\"sports-psychology/exercise-mental-health\">运动与心理健康</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>时间有限</strong>：第 1 章 + 第 3 章是性价比最高的组合，覆盖&quot;学习原理 + 教学应用&quot;主干。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四章相对独立，可按需切入；唯一强依赖是第 3 章的动机与第 1 章的自我调节学习互为支撑，建议成对阅读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：无专业前置，能读懂表格与流程图、愿意接受&quot;学习是主动建构而非被动接收&quot;的认识论即可。</li>\n<li><strong>建议先读（会读得更深）</strong>：<a href=\"../developmental-psychology/childhood/piaget-stages\">皮亚杰认知发展阶段</a> 与 <a href=\"../developmental-psychology/childhood/vygotsky-zone\">最近发展区</a>——第 1 章的两大理论根基；<a href=\"../emotion-motivation-psychology/motivation-theories/self-determination\">自我决定理论</a>——第 3 章动机章的母体；<a href=\"../learning-behavioral-psychology/operant-conditioning/skinner-reinforcement\">强化原理</a>——理解课堂管理行为视角的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>可后补</strong>：测量学（<a href=\"../psychometrics/measurement-foundations/reliability-classical-test-theory\">信度</a>/<a href=\"../psychometrics/measurement-foundations/validity-theory\">效度</a>）只在第 3 章评估反馈处需要，读到再查即可。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"learning-theories","title":"学习理论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/learning-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constructivism","title":"建构主义学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/learning-theories/constructivism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-regulated-learning","title":"自我调节学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/learning-theories/self-regulated-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"situated-learning","title":"情境学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/learning-theories/situated-learning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"transfer-of-learning","title":"学习迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/learning-theories/transfer-of-learning"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"school-psychology","title":"学校心理学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/school-psychology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"school-readiness","title":"入学准备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/school-psychology/school-readiness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bullying-prevention","title":"欺凌预防","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/school-psychology/bullying-prevention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gifted-education","title":"天才教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/school-psychology/gifted-education"},{"seq":4,"slug":"special-education","title":"特殊教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/school-psychology/special-education"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"instructional-psychology","title":"教学心理学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/instructional-psychology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motivation-in-education","title":"学习动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/instructional-psychology/motivation-in-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classroom-management","title":"课堂管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/instructional-psychology/classroom-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"assessment-feedback","title":"评估与反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/instructional-psychology/assessment-feedback"},{"seq":4,"slug":"teacher-student-relationship","title":"师生关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/instructional-psychology/teacher-student-relationship"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sports-psychology","title":"运动心理学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/sports-psychology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"peak-performance","title":"巅峰表现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/sports-psychology/peak-performance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mental-toughness","title":"心理韧性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/sports-psychology/mental-toughness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visualization-imagery","title":"表象训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/sports-psychology/visualization-imagery"},{"seq":4,"slug":"exercise-mental-health","title":"运动与心理健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/educational-psychology/sports-psychology/exercise-mental-health"}]}]}